<div class="page-banner">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</p>
    <h1>About canoepolo.eu</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap narrow-page prose">
  <p>canoepolo.eu is the home of international canoe polo (kayak polo): a free, independent place for the whole canoe polo family. Players, coaches, referees, volunteers, clubs and fans can all find what they need here.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/tournaments">Tournaments</a>: a calendar of club tournaments, leagues and championships</li>
    <li><a href="/watch">Watch</a>: highlights, finals and live streams</li>
    <li><a href="/learn">Learn</a>: the rules, a tactics board, and how to referee</li>
    <li><a href="/get-involved">Get involved</a>: playing, coaching, refereeing and volunteering</li>
    <li><a href="/support">Support and funding</a> for clubs and teams</li>
  </ul>
  <p>It's run by players, for players, and it grows with your help: send us tournaments, videos, news and ideas.</p>

  <h2 id="listing">List a tournament</h2>
  <p>Organising a tournament? The easiest way is to <a class="btn primary" href="https://www.kayakers.nl/Account/Register" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Create a tournament on Kayakers.nl</a>. The tournament calendar there feeds this site, so your event can appear here too.</p>
  <p>Prefer to message us? Send us on WhatsApp:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Tournament name and dates</li>
    <li>Venue, city and country</li>
    <li>Divisions (e.g. Men, Women, U21, Masters)</li>
    <li>Registration link or website, entry fee and closing date</li>
    <li>A contact name and email or phone</li>
  </ul>
  <p><a class="btn primary" href="https://wa.me/353876789927?text=Tournament%20listing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp +353 87 678 9927</a></p>

  <h2 id="sources">Where the listings come from</h2>
  <p>Tournament details come from organisers and from public announcements, and every listing links to its source. Some listings are taken from the <a href="https://cpt.kayakers.nl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kayakers.nl canoe polo tournament calendar</a>, used with the permission of its maintainer. Always check the organiser's own information before you enter or travel.</p>

  <h2>Follow the calendar</h2>
  <p>Add this link to Google Calendar, Apple Calendar or Outlook and new tournaments will appear automatically:</p>
  <p><code><%= BASE_URL %>/calendar.ics</code></p>

  <h2>Data feed</h2>
  <p>Clubs and developers can use the public data feed at <a href="/api/tournaments"><code>/api/tournaments</code></a> (filters: <code>country</code>, <code>level</code>, <code>division</code>, <code>month</code>, <code>q</code>, <code>when=past</code>).</p>
</div>

